    "label": "Product",
    "bodyText": "Product\nUse Cases\nkeyboard_arrow_down\nPricing\nBlog\nResources\nkeyboard_arrow_down\nDownload\ndownload\nAgents that help you achieve liftoff\nDownload for x64\nDownload for ARM64\nSee Google Antigravity in action\n\nWatch to learn how you can transform your development workflow\n\nplay_arrow\nWatch tutorial\nplay_arrow\n\nnote_stack\n\nEvolving to agent-first\n\nIntroducing a new agent-first Agent Manager experience. This innovative approach enables agents to operate seamlessly across all surfaces, including your browser, so they can tackle more complex and long-running tasks.\n\ndeployed_code\n\nA more natural abstraction\n\nGain a complete understanding of agentic operations at the task level, supported by the essential artifacts and verification outcomes, fostering confidence in the agent's actions.\n\nautomatic_cluster\n\nGuidance to go from 90% to 100%\n\nIntuitively provide feedback across every surface and Artifact to steer the agent to your desired outcomes.\n\nExplore the product\nAn agent-first experience\nAgent manager\n\nYour mission control to manage multiple agents in parallel, across multiple workspaces.\n\nEditor\n\nFully-featured AI-powered IDE with Tab, Command, Agents, and more.\n\nAgent\n\nAble to autonomously operate across your editor, terminal, and browser.\n\nArtifacts\n\nDeliverables from the Agent to communicate its progress with you.\n\nUser Feedback\n\nLeave comments and feedback on any Artifact to better guide the Agent.\n\nKnowledge\n\nAntigravity learns from conversations to populate a reusable knowledge base.\n\nBrowser Use\n\nThe agent can use Chrome to navigate and interact with pages for testing.\n\nBuilt for productivity\n\nSee what builders and developers like you have been able to achieve with Google Antigravity.\n\nAuto-playing Pinball Machine\n\nplay_arrow\nplay_arrow\nWatch case\n\nFlight Tracker App\n\nplay_arrow\nplay_arrow\nWatch case\n\nInverted Pendulum Controller\n\nplay_arrow\nplay_arrow\nWatch case\n\nCollaborative Whiteboard App\n\nplay_arrow\nplay_arrow\nWatch case\nkeyboard_arrow_left\nkeyboard_arrow_right\nDownload Google Antigravity for\nfor Windows\nDownload for x64\nDownload for ARM64\n\nExperience liftoff\n\nDownload\nProduct\nDocs\nChangelog\nPress\nReleases\nBlog\nPricing\nUse Cases\nAbout Google\nGoogle Products\nPrivacy\nTerms",
